{
    "title": "Scream The Game",
    "description": "This app is designed to be used with the Scream The Game from Funko Games. This cooperative board game is played in real time. It's a fun, tense and fast-paced experience! Work together to play cards as fast as you can. Rush to draw and trade for the cards you need to complete your scene. If you complete all the scenes before time runs out, and before any player is killed, you all win! If not, Ghost Face gets you and you all lose!\r\n\r\nGhost Face (voiced by Roger L. Jackson) will call you using this app to taunt, threaten, or stalk players during the game as described in the instructions and how to play video. Make sure to keep working together and prevent players from becoming Ghost Face's next victim!\r\n\r\nNeed more of a challenge? Select Hard Mode in the Settings and Ghost Face calls more often and you have less time to win.\r\n\r\nThe game defaults to Moderate language, but you may choose Strong language for more graphic and intense narration from Ghost Face.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This app is designed to be used with the Scream The Game from Funko Games. This cooperative board game is played in real time. It&#39;s a fun, tense and fast-paced experience! Work together to play cards as fast as you can. Rush to draw and trade for the cards you need to complete your scene. If you complete all the scenes before time runs out, and before any player is killed, you all win! If not, Ghost Face gets you and you all lose!<br><br>Ghost Face (voiced by Roger L. Jackson) will call you using this app to taunt, threaten, or stalk players during the game as described in the instructions and how to play video. Make sure to keep working together and prevent players from becoming Ghost Face&#39;s next victim!<br><br>Need more of a challenge? Select Hard Mode in the Settings and Ghost Face calls more often and you have less time to win.<br><br>The game defaults to Moderate language, but you may choose Strong language for more graphic and intense narration from Ghost Face.",
